  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Teacher Kim has a pencil. \"Draw a house.\" \"Look at that example.\" The example is a small house. Lily and Mia look at that. They get a pencil.",
      "Lily draws a big house. Mia draws a red door. She is happy. Oh no! The door is not good. It is too big. \"Get your eraser.\" Mia gets her eraser. She draws a new door.",
      "Teacher Kim looks at their pictures. Lily asks, \"Is it good?\" \"Yes, it is!\" \"Thumbs up!\" Lily smiles. Mia smiles too. It is a good class."
    ],
